  itemName: Guitar
  modelPrefab: {fileID: 1782445600872311063, guid: 97f7922cf48371241b9d4b25c3669613, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - I'm surprised that this thing is still intact. Who knows how long it's been under
    the water.
  - I'm sure it's still unplayable. But if it was, I probably could take a break
    and play a couple songs. I almost wish I could.
  - My fingers are itching to play, as if I used to play all the time. Spend a night
    at a bonfire with some friends, playing some songs. What a peaceful time that
    would be...
